FAIR_COMPARISON: NO
  SSZ inherits GR normalization then applies corrections.
  Raw MF-SNR penalizes any deviation from GR template shape.
  Correct approach: normalized overlap per sub-band.

=== THREE VARIANT DECOMPOSITION ===
[ESTIMATED — not yet numerically computed]
  Variant A (phase-only):   h_SSZ = h_GR * exp(i*deltaPsi)
    overlap ~0.1-0.5 (depends on sub-band)
  Variant B (amplitude-only): h_SSZ = h_GR * (1+deltaA)
