=== RECOMMENDATIONS ===
1. Normalize both templates to L²=1 before comparing
2. Use overlap ⟨h_GR|h_SSZ⟩/√(⟨h_GR|h_GR⟩⟨h_SSZ|h_SSZ⟩) per sub-band
3. Phase-only and amplitude-only variants for decomposition
4. Sub-band analysis (20-100 Hz, 100-200 Hz, 200-400 Hz, 400-800 Hz)

